# 30-Second Caregiver Understanding Test

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-caregiver-understanding-test.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-caregiver-understanding-test.md)

## Midnight question

If a stressed caregiver reads this in 30 seconds, do they understand the situation **better than before**?  
If no → reject.

## Must improve at least one

Understanding · Orientation · Uncertainty reduction · Priority  

Rich captures: improve more than one.

## Reject

Echo · task lists · interview overload · family distraction · false reassurance · false certainty

